            <h3>A $500B+ global problem with no dominant solution.</h3>
            <p>Textile waste is one of the fastest-growing waste streams globally. Municipalities spend millions on disposal while residents lack clear guidance. Sorty fills this gap with AI-powered decision support mapped to local circular infrastructure.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card" data-reveal-item>
            <span class="eyebrow">Business model</span>
            <h3>Dual revenue: B2G pilots + B2B licensing.</h3>
            <p>Municipal pilot contracts provide recurring SaaS revenue and diversion data. Corporate experiences and brand licensing create additional revenue streams. Community events build brand trust and generate proprietary training data.</p>
          </article>
