          <h2>Computer vision + geospatial AI — not a simple database.</h2>
          <p>Sorty combines on-device garment classification, condition assessment questionnaires, and geospatial mapping of circular infrastructure. This hybrid approach delivers higher accuracy than lookup tools and generates anonymized diversion analytics that municipalities and grant bodies require.</p>
